Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
(SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0). See the file
LICENSE-CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 for the official licence reference.

Scope — this licence applies ONLY to content that is original to RDCL:

  (a) It does NOT apply to the HMCL-derived source code, which must be
      conveyed as a whole under GPLv3 (see section 2 above; GPLv3 5(c)).

  (b) It does NOT apply to any artwork, wallpaper, icon or other asset that
      originates from the upstream HMCL project or its contributors
      (including the built-in wallpapers, upstream icons and the logos
      credited in the About page). We are not the copyright holders of that
      material and convey it unchanged under its original GPLv3 terms.

  (c) Where RDCL-original artwork ships inside the binary distribution, it
      forms part of an AGGREGATE of independent works within the meaning of
      GPLv3 section 5; each part of the aggregate keeps its own licence and
      this does not extend the GPLv3 licence to the artwork, nor the
      CC BY-NC-SA licence to the program.

  (d) The NonCommercial (NC) term applies to RDCL's own documentation and
      artwork only. It does not restrict, limit or modify any right granted
      by GPLv3 for the combined program itself.

  (e) The upstream additional terms in section 3 are unaffected by this
      section.

